OL,3,ARaise the Colours founder charged with
OL,4,A14 offences
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe founder of an activist group which
OL,7,Fhas been putting Union Jack and St
OL,8,FGeorge's Cross flags on lampposts has
OL,9,Fbeen charged with a string of offences
OL,10,Fincluding racially aggravated
OL,11,Fharassment, threatening behaviour and
OL,12,Fassault.
OL,14,FRyan Bridge, 45, of Blackwell,
OL,15,FBromsgrove, Worcestershire, has been
OL,16,Ferecting flags in the Midlands and the
OL,17,Fsouth of England since last summer as
OL,18,Fpart of Raise the Colours.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
