OL,3,ARaise the Colours founder charged with
OL,4,A14 offences
OL,5,
OL,6,FThames Valley Police said Bridge had
OL,7,Fbeen charged with 14 offences from a
OL,8,Ftwo-month period in Oxfordshire earlier
OL,9,Fthis year.
OL,11,FHe is due to appear at Oxford
OL,12,FMagistrates' Court on 3 November.
